{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412120","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1041212001:1":{"text":"카프라, 네 검술 솜씨는 정말 대단해.","source_cn":"卡夫拉，你的剑术十分了得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32D206EDDD68FEA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041212002:1":{"text":"실례가 안 된다면, 나에게 검술을 좀 가르쳐줄 수 있어?","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，不知你能否为我指点一二？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x708B339E870163A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041212003:1":{"text":"구구, 별말씀을요, 에이론 님! 이 검술은 그냥 저처럼 질주하다가 바람에 모든 것을 맡기면 됩니다!","source_cn":"咕唔，无需客气，埃隆大人！此剑法破风而行，只需如吾这般...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE45BC4F12B5444C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041212004:1":{"text":"그렇구나. 너처럼 민첩해지려면 난 더 많은 훈련이 필요하겠어...","source_cn":"原来如此。只是想像你这般敏捷并不容易，看来我仍旧需要多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28B280A7C35286B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041212005:1":{"text":"하지만... 카프라 님은 다리가 네 개잖아요! 에이론 님이 아무리 훈련해도 그 속도로 달릴 순 없어요!!","source_cn":"可是……他有四条腿呀！埃隆你怎么也跑不到那个速度吧！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FBB99BD6DE6D510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_tit